        "info": "In Alicat's default PD/PDF loop, the D gain acts like a classical P term and the P gain like a classical I term. Change gains in small steps.\n\nThe write button uses example gains for the simulator. On a real instrument, read the gains first and note them, change them in small steps, and write the noted values back to restore them.",
